00:06:59.240 --> 00:07:01.300
Yo! Murai!

00:07:05.580 --> 00:07:08.180
How about going for a run
with me?

00:07:09.540 --> 00:07:12.210
What you need most now
is to sweat.

00:07:12.210 --> 00:07:14.700
Sorry, but I've got the special
advanced class.

00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:18.190
- I know, Murai.
- What's that?

00:07:18.190 --> 00:07:20.370
Something's bothering you.

00:07:20.370 --> 00:07:23.320
Don't hold back,
talk to me about it.

00:07:23.640 --> 00:07:26.940
I ain't got anything to talk
to you about.

00:07:27.290 --> 00:07:29.190
Alright then!

00:07:29.190 --> 00:07:31.090
Let's have a contest!

00:07:31.090 --> 00:07:33.690
Why should I do that?

00:07:33.690 --> 00:07:36.600
If I win, then I want you
to promise to return

00:07:36.600 --> 00:07:39.200
to Onizuka-sensei's class
in the fall.

00:07:40.630 --> 00:07:42.030
Oh, I see.

00:07:42.030 --> 00:07:43.940
So Onizuka-sensei
asked you to help.

00:07:44.640 --> 00:07:48.810
I heard you were a star swimmer
in intermediate school.

00:07:49.840 --> 00:07:53.700
Well, I'll teach you that outside,
there's always someone better.

00:07:56.600 --> 00:07:57.800
1,000 yen on Hakamada!

00:07:57.800 --> 00:07:59.100
- Me too!
- And me!

00:07:59.100 --> 00:08:02.890
Hey you guys, that doesn't
make a bet! Geeze!

00:08:02.890 --> 00:08:05.140
- 4,000 yen on Murai!
- What?

00:08:05.140 --> 00:08:07.700
Onitchi! Shouldn't you bet
on Hakamada?

00:08:07.700 --> 00:08:09.900
That's right! He's trying
to convince Murai.

00:08:09.900 --> 00:08:12.100
Stupid! That and this
is a different thing!

00:08:49.710 --> 00:08:51.160
How's that, Murai?

00:08:51.160 --> 00:08:55.930
Such a workout makes you
forget all your troubles...

00:09:00.640 --> 00:09:02.570
No... no way!

00:09:08.120 --> 00:09:11.180
I was a little unprepared before.

00:09:11.580 --> 00:09:14.580
And swimming is your
specialty too.

00:09:15.600 --> 00:09:18.700
But that won't happen
in the 100 meters.

00:09:23.740 --> 00:09:25.490
Sorry about this, Murai.

00:09:25.490 --> 00:09:27.090
But don't feel bad if you lose.

00:09:27.090 --> 00:09:29.700
I am a phys ed teacher, after all.

00:09:29.700 --> 00:09:31.000
Okay!

00:09:50.000 --> 00:09:51.490
How?!

00:09:57.360 --> 00:09:58.770
1,000 yen!

00:09:59.650 --> 00:10:01.840
Oh, thanks! Sorry!

00:10:03.800 --> 00:10:04.950
Hey! Murai!

00:10:04.950 --> 00:10:06.620
Good work!

00:10:06.620 --> 00:10:08.950
Hey, thanks to you,
I made quite a bit!

00:10:08.950 --> 00:10:10.650
I'll treat you to something.

00:10:10.650 --> 00:10:13.200
- How low can you go?
- What's that?

00:10:13.200 --> 00:10:15.300
You shouldn't go asking
Hakamada to try

00:10:15.300 --> 00:10:16.500
and convince us for you.

00:10:16.500 --> 00:10:18.740
That idiot just decided
on his own...

00:10:18.740 --> 00:10:20.700
Stop making excuses.

00:10:20.700 --> 00:10:23.570
If we don't return to class by fall,
you'll be fired.

00:10:23.570 --> 00:10:26.400
That's right! I always forget
about that!

00:10:26.400 --> 00:10:28.770
Yeah right! I'm sure you're
worried about it.

00:10:28.770 --> 00:10:32.200
Not really. Whether I worry
or not, you won't come back

00:10:32.200 --> 00:10:33.600
to school anyway, right?

00:10:34.200 --> 00:10:36.100
Then are you just going
to ignore it?

00:10:36.100 --> 00:10:37.180
So...

00:10:37.180 --> 00:10:38.680
do you have any good ideas?

00:10:38.680 --> 00:10:41.330
How can I get you to end
your boycott?

00:10:41.330 --> 00:10:44.020
Why ask me?

00:10:44.020 --> 00:10:46.090
Hey, Murai!

00:10:46.090 --> 00:10:49.450
Because the best person to ask
about you, is you, right?

00:10:49.450 --> 00:10:51.980
C'mon, I'll give you
the 8,000 yen I just won.

00:10:56.300 --> 00:10:58.000
Damn! That was close!

00:10:58.000 --> 00:11:00.000
Look where you're driving,
dumb ass!

00:11:10.270 --> 00:11:11.470
What about you?

00:11:11.470 --> 00:11:13.900
Why don't you look where
you're walking, dimwit!

00:11:14.400 --> 00:11:15.650
Mom...

00:11:16.400 --> 00:11:20.350
Kunio-kun, this is your mom?

00:11:20.350 --> 00:11:23.470
Kunio, who the heck is this?

00:11:23.470 --> 00:11:25.170
My homeroom teacher.

00:11:25.660 --> 00:11:27.160
Homeroom teacher!

00:11:27.600 --> 00:11:31.180
Pleased to meet you,
I'm Onizuka Eikichi.

00:11:32.890 --> 00:11:34.030
I'm so sorry!

00:11:34.030 --> 00:11:37.770
I thought for sure you were one
of those punks. I'm sorry!

00:11:39.530 --> 00:11:42.700
But I was so surprised
that Murai-kun's mom

00:11:42.700 --> 00:11:44.340
is so young and pretty!

00:11:44.340 --> 00:11:47.340
Oh my, you're such
a sweet talker.

00:11:47.340 --> 00:11:50.000
But being a truck driver
is pretty cool!

00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:52.900
It's nothing but hard work,
there's a lot of all-nighters.

00:11:52.900 --> 00:11:55.200
But the pay is good.

00:11:55.200 --> 00:11:57.430
Because he doesn't
have a father,

00:11:57.430 --> 00:12:00.890
I have to make sure everything
is provided for.

00:12:01.060 --> 00:12:05.000
That's why Kunio worked so hard
to get into Seirin Academy.

00:12:05.000 --> 00:12:07.300
You're great! You are
the epitomy of a mother!

00:12:07.300 --> 00:12:09.040
How embarrassing!
Don't say that!

00:12:09.040 --> 00:12:11.200
- Right, Kunio-kun?
- Whatcha looking at!

00:12:11.200 --> 00:12:12.900
What are you talking about?

00:12:12.900 --> 00:12:15.100
Don't play innocent,
you pervert teacher!

00:12:15.100 --> 00:12:16.500
What are you saying, Kunio!

00:12:16.500 --> 00:12:18.680
He was checking you
out just now!

00:12:18.910 --> 00:12:21.400
He wouldn't do that!
He's your homeroom teacher.

00:12:21.400 --> 00:12:22.400
Don't be stupid!

00:12:22.400 --> 00:12:25.400
I'm sorry, I think he suffers from
a bit of a mother complex.

00:12:25.400 --> 00:12:28.500
That's alright. I think all men
suffer from a mother complex.

00:12:34.430 --> 00:12:37.000
It's times like this that
makes me think,

00:12:37.000 --> 00:12:38.920
it'd be better if he had a father.

00:12:38.920 --> 00:12:40.930
Oh? What happened
to his father?

00:12:40.930 --> 00:12:44.400
Just after Kunio was born,
he was in a motorcycle accident.

00:12:44.400 --> 00:12:45.500
He was so reckless!

00:12:46.970 --> 00:12:48.140
Here.

00:12:49.830 --> 00:12:51.530
This!

00:12:51.930 --> 00:12:55.670
He's Murai-san,
the great third Wild Angel!

00:12:55.670 --> 00:12:58.300
- Oh? You know him?
- Of course!

00:12:58.300 --> 00:13:01.300
There isn't anyone in the Shônan
that doesn't know him!

00:13:02.000 --> 00:13:04.500
Does that mean you were
formerly a gang member?

00:13:04.500 --> 00:13:06.660
Yeah, well,
I wasn't anyone important.

00:13:06.660 --> 00:13:10.500
Oh! No wonder it's so easy
for me to talk to you!

00:13:10.500 --> 00:13:11.500
Isn't it?

00:13:11.500 --> 00:13:14.190
Hey Murai! Your dad was
a great person, you know!

00:13:14.190 --> 00:13:18.090
- He was like a god to us!
- I don't care!

00:13:20.460 --> 00:13:22.000
You have to excuse him.

00:13:22.000 --> 00:13:24.000
Whenever talk of his father
comes up,

00:13:24.000 --> 00:13:25.300
he always get's like this.

00:13:25.300 --> 00:13:27.500
That's why I've got more
cool pictures,

00:13:27.500 --> 00:13:29.400
but this is the only one
we put up.

00:13:29.400 --> 00:13:32.270
Kunio-kun's more delicate
than he looks, isn't he?

00:13:32.270 --> 00:13:35.600
- You can tell?
- Yes, I can!

00:13:35.600 --> 00:13:38.000
At that age, they go through
so many emotions

00:13:38.000 --> 00:13:39.800
and things they don't
understand.

00:13:39.800 --> 00:13:41.210
You're so right!

00:13:41.210 --> 00:13:44.100
I'm so glad I was able to talk
to you, Onizuka-sensei!

00:13:44.100 --> 00:13:47.000
Because you know, every time
I went in to discuss things,

00:13:47.000 --> 00:13:49.400
his homeroom teacher
would be different.

00:13:49.400 --> 00:13:51.970
Leave it to me!
You can come to me anytime!

00:13:51.970 --> 00:13:54.130
Oh! I'm so glad!

00:13:54.870 --> 00:13:57.770
What's with your big
teacher act!

00:13:57.770 --> 00:14:00.400
Kunio! How dare you
talk like that!

00:14:00.400 --> 00:14:04.170
Don't be fooled! This guy just
wants to do it with you!

00:14:04.170 --> 00:14:06.170
Can't you see that!

00:14:07.360 --> 00:14:10.560
Don't I always tell you, don't
judge people by their looks!

00:14:13.370 --> 00:14:14.790
Come here!

00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:22.600
I'm sorry.

00:14:24.430 --> 00:14:27.630
He wasn't always like that.

00:14:27.630 --> 00:14:31.800
He used to say, when he
grew up, he'd take care of me.

00:14:31.800 --> 00:14:34.200
He said he was going
to become a lawyer.

00:14:40.600 --> 00:14:44.200
With that kind of attitude,
nothing will change.

00:14:45.000 --> 00:14:47.100
Fuyutsuki-sensei,
are you listening?

00:14:47.100 --> 00:14:49.400
What? Of course!

00:14:49.400 --> 00:14:51.400
You're talking about
Murai-kun, right?

00:14:51.400 --> 00:14:54.340
He won't understand how
I feel at all.

00:14:54.800 --> 00:14:57.600
Is he mistakenly applying
his boycott to me?

00:14:57.600 --> 00:14:59.700
No, I don't think so.

00:14:59.700 --> 00:15:03.700
Really? I think you're the only one
who'll say that, Fuyutsuki-sensei.

00:15:03.700 --> 00:15:06.170
But I can't give up just
because of this.

00:15:06.170 --> 00:15:11.830
Like Kinpachi-sensei, I was
worried about his suffering!

00:15:12.350 --> 00:15:14.840
That's right! You can't give up!

00:15:14.840 --> 00:15:18.240
I'm glad I had a chance to talk
to you, Fuyutsuki-sensei!

00:15:18.240 --> 00:15:21.710
I've gotten the motivation back
to try again tomorrow!

00:15:21.710 --> 00:15:24.210
Let's drink up tonight!

00:15:24.210 --> 00:15:26.580
Oh! Look at the time!
I have to go...

00:15:26.580 --> 00:15:29.150
You know, I have many dreams...

00:15:29.150 --> 00:15:30.600
First, to have our track

00:15:30.600 --> 00:15:33.350
and swimming teams
nationally ranked.

00:15:33.350 --> 00:15:34.920
And then...

00:15:34.920 --> 00:15:40.450
I've found my marriage partner
within the teaching department.

00:15:41.260 --> 00:15:44.000
Such enthusiasm in teaching,

00:15:44.000 --> 00:15:49.000
to work hand in hand,
isn't that the perfect teacher?

00:15:49.000 --> 00:15:51.000
Fuyutsuki-sensei,
are you listening?

00:15:51.740 --> 00:15:54.200
- What?
- Right?

00:15:54.900 --> 00:15:56.300
Of course!

00:15:57.830 --> 00:15:58.880
Um...

00:15:58.880 --> 00:16:01.000
Fuyutsuki-sensei...

00:16:01.000 --> 00:16:03.300
would you like to be with me
to make my dream...

00:16:03.300 --> 00:16:04.700
Let's go somewhere else!

00:16:06.340 --> 00:16:09.030
I can't relax here.

00:16:09.030 --> 00:16:11.400
Of course! We should go
somewhere quieter

00:16:11.400 --> 00:16:13.240
to discuss things this important.

00:16:13.240 --> 00:16:15.140
Excuse me, check please!

00:16:15.790 --> 00:16:16.840
Oh!

00:16:16.840 --> 00:16:18.540
Onizuka-sensei?

00:16:18.540 --> 00:16:21.020
Hey! Good to see you!

00:16:21.020 --> 00:16:23.140
Oh? Could you be on a date?

00:16:23.140 --> 00:16:25.400
What? What are you saying!

00:16:25.400 --> 00:16:28.600
Hakamada-sensei and I would
never do something like that!

00:16:28.600 --> 00:16:31.700
Hakamada-sensei just needed
to discuss some things,

00:16:31.700 --> 00:16:32.820
so I'm here to listen.

00:16:32.820 --> 00:16:35.630
So, are you on a date?

00:16:36.130 --> 00:16:38.520
- No, we're not, right?
- Don't...

00:16:38.520 --> 00:16:40.300
It's a parent teacher conference.

00:16:40.300 --> 00:16:42.120
Don't try to fool me!

00:16:42.120 --> 00:16:46.620
Such a young and beautiful
woman, she can't be a parent.

00:16:49.230 --> 00:16:52.030
I'm sorry he's always
so much trouble.

00:16:52.030 --> 00:16:54.130
I'm Murai Kunio's mother.

00:16:54.470 --> 00:16:56.730
- What?
- There!

00:17:00.200 --> 00:17:02.580
If you're 34...

00:17:02.580 --> 00:17:05.080
then you had Kunio-kun
when you were 17?

00:17:05.080 --> 00:17:06.800
Right. At that time,

00:17:06.800 --> 00:17:10.450
I wholeheartedly was
determined to have him.

00:17:10.450 --> 00:17:14.730
Oh, did we argue!
My parents were really harsh!

00:17:15.110 --> 00:17:19.760
But right after he was born,
you lost your husband, right?

00:17:19.760 --> 00:17:22.030
- Yup.
- Didn't you have any regrets?

00:17:22.030 --> 00:17:25.500
Not at all! Because I gave birth
to the child of the man I loved

00:17:25.500 --> 00:17:26.800
the most in the world!

00:17:27.600 --> 00:17:31.040
So, Fuyutsuki-sensei, is there
someone you're in love with?

00:17:31.040 --> 00:17:32.250
What?

00:17:33.580 --> 00:17:35.590
- Oops!
- That's cold!

00:17:35.590 --> 00:17:38.920
- Oh! I'm sorry!
- That tickles!

00:17:38.920 --> 00:17:42.300
- There isn't anyone!
- So, what's your type?

00:17:42.300 --> 00:17:43.980
It doesn't matter!

00:17:43.980 --> 00:17:46.760
No, we want to know,
right Onizuka-sensei?

00:17:46.760 --> 00:17:50.580
- What? Sure.
- I'm fine!

00:17:51.300 --> 00:17:53.770
What have you been
doing here, Onizuka-sensei?

00:17:53.770 --> 00:17:56.020
What? What do you mean?

00:17:56.020 --> 00:17:58.400
Murai-san, you better
watch out for this man.

00:17:58.400 --> 00:17:59.400
Why's that?

00:17:59.400 --> 00:18:02.200
Even though he's a teacher,
there's no knowing what he'll do!

00:18:02.200 --> 00:18:05.000
Oh no! He didn't do anything
strange to you already, did he?

00:18:05.000 --> 00:18:07.300
Of course not!
Being with him is enjoyable!

00:18:07.300 --> 00:18:10.710
Me too! I almost forget that we
are a parent and a teacher.

00:18:10.710 --> 00:18:14.260
You see, Onizuka-sensei reminds
me of my late husband.

00:18:14.260 --> 00:18:17.170
What! No! I'm nothing
compared to Murai-san!

00:18:17.170 --> 00:18:20.170
If he doesn't have a girlfriend,
then I might fall for him!

00:18:20.170 --> 00:18:21.800
That's my line!

00:18:21.800 --> 00:18:23.700
Do you really not have
a boyfriend?

00:18:23.700 --> 00:18:24.920
No, I don't!

00:18:24.920 --> 00:18:27.400
Excuse me, but what we were
just talking about...

00:18:27.400 --> 00:18:30.760
- Huh? What was that?
- About Fuyutsuki-sensei's type!

00:18:30.760 --> 00:18:33.150
Oh! That's right!

00:18:33.480 --> 00:18:37.870
I think her ideals might
be pretty high.

00:18:37.870 --> 00:18:41.210
For example, his references
need to be perfect.

00:18:41.660 --> 00:18:43.630
When I was young, I felt like that.

00:18:43.630 --> 00:18:47.710
But now, I think it's "heart",

00:18:47.710 --> 00:18:51.500
someone with enthusiasm,
like Hakamada-sensei!

00:18:51.500 --> 00:18:52.800
No way!

00:18:52.800 --> 00:18:57.510
And someone with big dreams,
like Hakamada-sensei!

00:18:57.510 --> 00:19:00.010
Oh, Fuyutsuki-sensei!

00:19:00.010 --> 00:19:03.830
Oh my! Could it be you two
are already an item?

00:19:04.080 --> 00:19:05.780
What are you saying!

00:19:05.780 --> 00:19:08.460
We're not like that at all!

00:19:09.800 --> 00:19:11.190
You should see each other!

00:19:11.190 --> 00:19:14.020
Since you're such
an ideal couple!

00:19:14.020 --> 00:19:17.000
- It shouldn't concern you, right?
- Hakamada-sensei,

00:19:17.000 --> 00:19:20.250
invite me to the wedding,
I'll go get a tuxedo!

00:19:20.250 --> 00:19:22.400
Stop it, Onizuka-sensei!

00:19:22.400 --> 00:19:25.900
Murai-san, please let me know
if he does something weird,

00:19:25.900 --> 00:19:27.700
- I'll call the police.
- Hey now!

00:19:27.700 --> 00:19:30.600
Would you please stop accusing
others of being perverts!

00:19:30.600 --> 00:19:33.100
Well, will you stop assuming
things about people?

00:19:33.100 --> 00:19:34.990
I'm just concerned for you!

00:19:34.990 --> 00:19:37.690
Well, I'm not stupid enough
to need your concern!

00:19:38.960 --> 00:19:41.100
What's with the way she's talking!

00:19:41.100 --> 00:19:43.500
Do you think a man could
fall in love with that?

00:19:43.500 --> 00:19:46.400
I'm not going to listen to such
a deficient man like you!

00:19:46.400 --> 00:19:48.520
Oh yeah?
Who's the deficient one?

00:19:48.520 --> 00:19:50.720
What? You're full of deficiencies!

00:19:50.720 --> 00:19:52.850
What! Show me a deficiency,
show me!

00:19:52.850 --> 00:19:55.700
- Your full of deficiencies!
- Like where?

00:19:55.700 --> 00:20:01.800
<i>Anata ni aitakute</i>

00:20:01.800 --> 00:20:05.000
<i>Aitakute</i>

00:20:05.000 --> 00:20:07.900
<i>Nemure nuyoru wa...</i>

00:20:07.900 --> 00:20:10.270
Onizuka-sensei, um...

00:20:11.310 --> 00:20:12.890
Oh, what number do you want?

00:20:12.890 --> 00:20:15.840
Oh no, I'm no good
at karaoke at all.

00:20:15.840 --> 00:20:18.060
It's about Fuyutsuki-sensei.

00:20:18.060 --> 00:20:20.040
What?

00:20:20.040 --> 00:20:23.300
I should confess my love,
shouldn't I?

00:20:23.300 --> 00:20:24.300
What?!

00:20:24.300 --> 00:20:26.710
Would it be better if I proposed?

00:20:28.070 --> 00:20:30.490
You should do whatever.

00:20:30.490 --> 00:20:34.090
Then... you'll support me,
Onizuka-sensei?

00:20:34.870 --> 00:20:36.470
Sure, sure.

00:20:36.470 --> 00:20:39.230
Thank you! I'll do my best!

00:20:39.600 --> 00:20:40.800
Thank you!

00:20:42.100 --> 00:20:43.300
Thank you!

00:20:44.100 --> 00:20:49.100
<i>Kôkai shinai deshô</i>

00:20:53.100 --> 00:20:59.100
<i>Kanashimi ni deau tabi</i>

00:21:00.490 --> 00:21:02.020
So...

00:21:02.020 --> 00:21:03.850
Fuyutsuki-sensei...

00:21:03.850 --> 00:21:07.300
I'll bet you've never really fallen
in love with anyone yet,

00:21:07.300 --> 00:21:09.760
- have you?
- Why do you say that?

00:21:09.760 --> 00:21:12.160
That's just the feeling I get.

00:21:12.860 --> 00:21:19.090
So, what made you decide
to marry your late husband?

00:21:19.090 --> 00:21:21.600
I wonder if it was the throbbing
in my heart.

00:21:21.600 --> 00:21:24.530
- Throbbing?
- Yup, for example,

00:21:24.530 --> 00:21:28.480
if I'm not with him,
it's totally boring.

00:21:29.450 --> 00:21:31.110
I see...

00:21:32.020 --> 00:21:36.060
So... is there anyone
like that in your life?

00:21:36.060 --> 00:21:39.600
- Of course not!
- If you do,

00:21:39.600 --> 00:21:42.700
just because you're a woman,
you better not wait to confess.

00:21:42.700 --> 00:21:46.640
Because you know, that person
may be dead tomorrow.

00:21:47.040 --> 00:21:48.500
Could it be...

00:21:48.500 --> 00:21:51.000
that you were the one
who proposed, Tsubasa-san?

00:21:51.000 --> 00:21:52.600
Of course!

00:21:52.600 --> 00:21:54.700
If I didn't then,

00:21:54.700 --> 00:21:57.500
then I think I would have
regretted it my whole life!

00:21:57.500 --> 00:22:00.560
Because Kunio wasn't born yet.

00:22:02.330 --> 00:22:05.390
So, what are you
going to do now?

00:22:05.390 --> 00:22:09.150
Alright! Let's hit one more place!

00:22:10.100 --> 00:22:12.500
I've got the special advanced
class tomorrow

00:22:12.500 --> 00:22:13.800
and have to wake up early.

00:22:13.800 --> 00:22:15.790
Sorry, I've got gym
tomorrow too.

00:22:15.790 --> 00:22:19.400
Really? It's summer vacation
and you're working so hard!

00:22:19.400 --> 00:22:20.560
What about you, Ei-chan?

00:22:20.560 --> 00:22:22.700
I've got nothing to do,
so I'll stay with you.

00:22:22.700 --> 00:22:25.490
Yay! I'm so happy!

00:22:25.490 --> 00:22:28.240
Okay! Let's party it up tonight!

00:22:28.680 --> 00:22:31.080
- Excuse us.
- Bye!

00:22:31.080 --> 00:22:32.380
Good night!

00:22:34.900 --> 00:22:36.900
Do you think, tonight,
those two might...

00:22:36.900 --> 00:22:37.990
What?!

00:22:40.440 --> 00:22:43.270
They wouldn't, right?
They're parent and teacher!

00:22:43.270 --> 00:22:44.880
Of course!

00:22:50.840 --> 00:22:53.100
- Oh! Good morning!
- What are you doing?

00:22:53.100 --> 00:22:54.700
It's so stinking hot at my place,

00:22:54.700 --> 00:22:57.100
I figured I'd go into
the principal's office.

00:22:57.100 --> 00:23:00.630
- Don't tell Uchiyamada!
- Oh! Your clothes!

00:23:01.070 --> 00:23:02.370
You didn't!

00:23:02.370 --> 00:23:04.470
You didn't...
with Murai-kun's mother...

00:23:04.470 --> 00:23:07.100
We made the rounds,
she wouldn't let me sleep!

00:23:07.100 --> 00:23:09.910
And so that's why you're
coming home in the morning?!

00:23:09.910 --> 00:23:11.530
Not so loud!

00:23:11.530 --> 00:23:13.760
You're making my head ring!

00:23:13.760 --> 00:23:16.000
Aren't you embarrassed at all?

00:23:16.000 --> 00:23:18.500
Doing things like that with
a student's mother!

00:23:18.500 --> 00:23:21.100
- Things like what?
- It's no use lying!

00:23:21.100 --> 00:23:23.900
From the beginning, I thought
the way you were looking

00:23:23.900 --> 00:23:26.100
- at her was inappropriate!
- I couldn't help it!

00:23:26.100 --> 00:23:29.480
Unlike someone I know,
Murai's mother is quite sexy.

00:23:29.480 --> 00:23:31.990
That's what I mean
by inappropriate!

00:23:31.990 --> 00:23:35.200
Oh, I see! You're jealous!

00:23:35.200 --> 00:23:38.000
What?! Why would I be!

00:23:38.000 --> 00:23:39.800
If you were just sincere
and asked,

00:23:39.800 --> 00:23:42.600
I would have told you
if something happened last night.

00:23:42.600 --> 00:23:44.200
Well, I didn't want
to know anyway!

00:23:44.200 --> 00:23:46.700
So, didn't something happen
with Hakamada and you?

00:23:46.700 --> 00:23:49.200
Hakamada-sensei isn't such
a vulgar man like you!

00:23:49.200 --> 00:23:51.300
Oh really? Then why don't you
go out with him,

00:23:51.300 --> 00:23:52.600
or are you going to keep me?

00:23:52.600 --> 00:23:55.000
Sorry to disappoint you,
I've stopped doing that.

00:23:55.000 --> 00:23:57.000
- Why the change of heart?
- Because...

00:23:58.990 --> 00:24:00.650
That's because...

00:24:01.790 --> 00:24:03.800
I've woken up to education.

00:24:03.800 --> 00:24:06.300
Unlike you who comes to
school to play,

00:24:06.300 --> 00:24:08.960
I'm busy with the special
advanced class!

00:24:08.960 --> 00:24:10.260
Good night.

00:24:10.720 --> 00:24:12.220
I'm still talking to you...

00:24:15.220 --> 00:24:16.720
What a pig!

00:24:19.620 --> 00:24:21.120
Ouch!

00:24:22.390 --> 00:24:24.490
For crying out loud!

00:24:38.930 --> 00:24:40.800
Damn!

00:24:41.590 --> 00:24:43.490
That Onizuka pisses me off!

00:24:43.490 --> 00:24:45.290
There's no need to get so mad.

00:24:45.290 --> 00:24:49.140
- Come fall, he'll be fired.
- I know, but...

00:24:54.720 --> 00:24:56.120
What is it?

00:24:57.800 --> 00:24:59.200
It's nothing.

00:25:03.110 --> 00:25:05.910
I just remembered...

00:25:06.320 --> 00:25:07.820
About him...

00:25:12.360 --> 00:25:15.060
It's almost the anniversary
of his death.

00:25:18.010 --> 00:25:19.710
Hey, Murai!

00:25:21.400 --> 00:25:23.600
How about it, want to have
lunch together?

00:25:23.600 --> 00:25:25.880
Sorry, but we're busy.

00:25:25.880 --> 00:25:29.260
Don't be like that!
I want to talk to you!

00:25:29.260 --> 00:25:32.580
Didn't you hear, we don't
have time for that.

00:25:33.530 --> 00:25:35.830
Hey! Hold on! Wait!

00:25:36.400 --> 00:25:39.100
They don't even try
to understand others' feelings!

00:25:40.830 --> 00:25:43.340
- Oh, that feels great!
- How's that?

00:25:43.340 --> 00:25:44.630
Not there, it tickles!

00:25:44.630 --> 00:25:46.400
Stop it!

00:25:46.400 --> 00:25:49.340
- Oh! Welcome home, Kunio!
- Yo Murai! Welcome home!

00:25:49.340 --> 00:25:52.640
Wow! Check it out!
This is really Murai-san's!

00:25:52.640 --> 00:25:54.810
- Can I have this?
- Sorry, not that.

00:25:54.810 --> 00:25:57.710
Can I borrow it? It's so cool!

00:25:58.740 --> 00:26:00.100
What's this?

00:26:01.790 --> 00:26:03.450
Get out!

00:26:04.400 --> 00:26:05.800
What's wrong, Kunio?

00:26:05.800 --> 00:26:09.100
They're here because they really
liked your dad, you know!

00:26:09.100 --> 00:26:12.800
That's right Murai! Do you know
how much we looked up to him?

00:26:12.800 --> 00:26:15.500
He ain't my father to me!

00:26:15.500 --> 00:26:17.600
Watch what you say!

00:26:18.560 --> 00:26:21.060
Do you know why he died?

00:26:21.930 --> 00:26:24.120
Some trash about
a man's challenge!

00:26:24.120 --> 00:26:27.030
He died proving his courage
on a bike.

00:26:27.380 --> 00:26:29.980
How can you look up to
a fool like that!

00:26:29.980 --> 00:26:32.080
- Now, now...
- Why you!

00:26:32.080 --> 00:26:33.280
Stop it!

00:26:36.900 --> 00:26:38.100
Stop it!

00:26:40.790 --> 00:26:42.990
He left his family.

00:26:42.990 --> 00:26:46.390
How can I love a man who just
goes off and dies!

00:26:47.780 --> 00:26:50.000
You were just bike gangs,

00:26:50.000 --> 00:26:53.050
don't go working him up
into something!

00:26:53.050 --> 00:26:55.170
What's that, you punk!

00:26:58.050 --> 00:27:00.350
- Kunio, stop it!
- Come on!

00:27:00.780 --> 00:27:03.600
Stop it! Please!

00:27:23.740 --> 00:27:25.640
You know, Onizuka-sensei...

00:27:25.640 --> 00:27:27.390
He's a good man.

00:27:27.390 --> 00:27:31.950
Men nowadays are usually all
so pathetic, but he's different.

00:27:31.950 --> 00:27:34.610
I think I could trust him,
don't you?

00:27:34.610 --> 00:27:37.660
There's no way I could trust
a teacher!

00:27:41.910 --> 00:27:43.910
Why are you like that now?

00:27:46.990 --> 00:27:48.690
What happened?

00:27:48.690 --> 00:27:51.090
Why don't you tell me already?

00:27:52.400 --> 00:27:54.730
It was after your best
friend died...

00:27:54.730 --> 00:27:56.500
I told you!

00:27:57.770 --> 00:28:00.070
Never bring that up again!

00:28:04.300 --> 00:28:06.800
UCHIYAMADA

00:28:07.340 --> 00:28:10.690
<i>X</i> minus...

00:28:11.510 --> 00:28:15.110
Why is high school math so hard...

00:28:16.010 --> 00:28:17.600
Hey! Hey! Hey!

00:28:17.600 --> 00:28:20.690
Mama, could you be a little
more quiet, I'm trying to study.

00:28:20.690 --> 00:28:23.490
Oh? Why does the head teacher
have to do that?

00:28:23.490 --> 00:28:26.100
It can't be helped,
Teshigawara from mathematics

00:28:26.100 --> 00:28:27.300
suddenly took time off.

00:28:27.300 --> 00:28:28.390
Oh?

00:28:28.390 --> 00:28:31.200
Say, wasn't that the man he was
complimenting before?

00:28:31.200 --> 00:28:33.900
- That's right!
- Listen, Yoshiko.

00:28:34.690 --> 00:28:36.200
These elite from Tôdai,

00:28:36.200 --> 00:28:38.900
when it comes to a critical
moment, they're useless.

00:28:38.900 --> 00:28:41.600
- Don't get involved with them.
- There's no need to worry.

00:28:41.600 --> 00:28:43.580
Eikichi's the only one for me.

00:28:43.580 --> 00:28:44.910
Eikichi?

00:28:44.910 --> 00:28:46.800
Is that the one who called
last time?

00:28:46.800 --> 00:28:50.430
You think so highly of him,
I told you to invite him over.

00:28:50.430 --> 00:28:52.830
Mama, are you checking out
young guys?

00:28:52.830 --> 00:28:54.200
What are you talking about!

00:28:54.200 --> 00:28:55.930
As your mother,
I'm just concerned!

00:28:55.930 --> 00:28:58.210
- Oh, Mom.
- Yoshiko!

00:28:58.210 --> 00:29:01.010
You should give up on
worthless men like him.

00:29:01.010 --> 00:29:04.030
But, Eikichi is a teacher,
you know!

00:29:04.830 --> 00:29:06.470
- Really?
- Yes.

00:29:06.470 --> 00:29:09.670
- Where? What school?
- I don't know.

00:29:10.210 --> 00:29:12.440
Why didn't you ask about that?

00:29:12.440 --> 00:29:16.210
The name or title doesn't
matter to me.

00:29:16.810 --> 00:29:18.510
What's important...

00:29:18.510 --> 00:29:20.310
is love!

00:29:21.580 --> 00:29:24.350
Eikichi... I'm going to call him!

00:29:26.510 --> 00:29:28.740
A teacher?

00:29:28.740 --> 00:29:30.470
Eikichi...

00:29:49.400 --> 00:29:52.550
Thank you for seeing me all
the way home.

00:29:52.550 --> 00:29:54.260
I thoroughly enjoyed today.

00:29:54.260 --> 00:29:57.060
Promise, now, right?

00:29:57.060 --> 00:29:59.460
You can count on me.
Tomorrow then?

00:30:00.250 --> 00:30:02.200
I'm looking forward to it!

00:30:06.850 --> 00:30:09.350
Oh! You're home!

00:30:21.080 --> 00:30:22.920
Good morning!

00:30:23.310 --> 00:30:26.100
Did you stay over
in the principal's office again?

00:30:26.100 --> 00:30:29.010
Last night was too hot.
Don't tell Uchiyamada.

00:30:29.010 --> 00:30:30.710
What is that?

00:30:31.110 --> 00:30:33.310
Here, pheromone perfume,
want some?

00:30:33.310 --> 00:30:35.820
- No, thank you!
- Okay...

00:30:36.210 --> 00:30:38.510
Are you going out on date now?

00:30:38.510 --> 00:30:40.610
You can tell?

00:30:41.290 --> 00:30:44.300
Could it be, with Murai-kun's
mother again?!

00:30:44.300 --> 00:30:45.890
You can tell?

00:30:48.700 --> 00:30:49.920
Could it be...

00:30:49.920 --> 00:30:51.920
You're really serious this time?

00:30:53.600 --> 00:30:55.700
Just what are you thinking!

00:30:55.700 --> 00:30:56.900
I'm off!

00:31:02.530 --> 00:31:04.430
"Zetsurin Super"?

00:31:05.710 --> 00:31:08.730
Murai-kun! I've been
waiting for you!

00:31:08.730 --> 00:31:10.760
Don't you ever come close
to my mom!

00:31:11.280 --> 00:31:14.200
Why? You can't dictate
her love life.

00:31:14.200 --> 00:31:16.300
Don't you try too fool
a student's mother,

00:31:16.300 --> 00:31:17.400
you pervert teacher!

00:31:17.400 --> 00:31:20.600
You don't have any right poking
in an adult's relationship, kid.

00:31:20.960 --> 00:31:24.110
- What the...!
- Okay, okay!

00:31:24.110 --> 00:31:26.630
If it bugs you so much,
then let's have a match.

00:31:49.900 --> 00:31:51.800
Fuyutsuki-sensei,
what are you doing?

00:31:51.800 --> 00:31:53.070
Well...

00:31:54.050 --> 00:31:56.150
- Hakamada-sensei.
- Yes?

00:31:56.150 --> 00:31:57.760
Could you come with me?

00:31:57.760 --> 00:32:00.380
- Sure!
- Thank you!

00:32:20.040 --> 00:32:21.440
Mom?

00:32:32.110 --> 00:32:34.260
The first to run loses.

00:32:36.800 --> 00:32:39.700
I want to give you a taste
of what your father was doing.

00:32:39.700 --> 00:32:41.850
Don't be stupid, you biker!

00:32:41.850 --> 00:32:44.590
If you're scared, then you
can quit, Kunio-chan.

00:32:44.590 --> 00:32:47.010
Go on home. Who's scared!

00:32:50.860 --> 00:32:53.130
If I win,

00:32:53.130 --> 00:32:55.760
then I'll do whatever you say.

00:32:56.550 --> 00:33:00.000
- Then I want you to disappear.
- Sure, I got it.

00:33:00.000 --> 00:33:01.900
I'm saying you'll have
to quit school!

00:33:01.900 --> 00:33:03.450
I said I got it!

00:33:06.440 --> 00:33:08.040
But on the other hand...

00:33:09.500 --> 00:33:11.900
If I win, then I want you
to tell me everything.

00:33:11.900 --> 00:33:14.850
- What are you talking about?
- About your best friend.

00:33:14.850 --> 00:33:16.850
Your mom told me.

00:33:17.350 --> 00:33:19.300
After some incident,

00:33:19.300 --> 00:33:21.900
you started bullying your
homeroom teachers.

00:33:22.400 --> 00:33:24.190
She talks too much...

00:33:25.320 --> 00:33:27.060
So, how about it, Murai?

00:33:33.570 --> 00:33:35.040
Alright.

00:33:42.020 --> 00:33:45.520
- Sensei!
- What are you two doing?

00:33:45.950 --> 00:33:47.600
Sensei! Don't be stupid!

00:33:47.600 --> 00:33:50.200
Nuts, looks like some annoying
people've shown up.

00:33:50.200 --> 00:33:52.550
Sensei! All set!

00:33:53.820 --> 00:33:55.720
Ready!

00:33:56.500 --> 00:33:58.630
Start!

00:33:58.630 --> 00:34:00.850
Okay! Let's go!

00:34:30.800 --> 00:34:34.460
- I... ain't gonna die!
- Stupid!

00:34:34.460 --> 00:34:38.180
Stop it! You're really
going to die!

00:34:38.180 --> 00:34:40.570
Why are you doing this!

00:34:41.800 --> 00:34:44.600
Please! Stop it!

00:34:46.940 --> 00:34:48.810
Hey! Stop!

00:34:48.810 --> 00:34:50.980
What is this going to achieve?

00:34:52.330 --> 00:34:54.380
Please! Stop!

00:34:59.010 --> 00:35:02.060
Quit it! Stop!

00:35:07.190 --> 00:35:09.860
- Hey! Is something wrong?
- That's getting too close!

00:35:09.860 --> 00:35:12.460
- Onitchi!
- Hey?

00:35:14.350 --> 00:35:17.150
Hey! Hey! What's going on?

00:35:17.990 --> 00:35:19.880
Hey! Run!

00:35:20.330 --> 00:35:21.880
Oh no! Hurry! Run!

00:35:23.240 --> 00:35:24.850
You're really going to die!

00:35:24.850 --> 00:35:27.150
- I... I can't!
- What?!

00:35:45.620 --> 00:35:47.020
Mom!

00:36:30.780 --> 00:36:32.220
Mom!

00:36:43.120 --> 00:36:44.520
She's okay.

00:36:46.330 --> 00:36:48.540
Aren't you glad, Murai?

00:36:48.540 --> 00:36:50.500
Ouch! Ow! Ow! Ow!

00:36:56.060 --> 00:36:57.400
Tsubasa-san!

00:36:57.970 --> 00:36:59.570
Are you okay?

00:36:59.980 --> 00:37:01.880
I'm fine! I'm fine!

00:37:01.880 --> 00:37:04.580
It'll take more than this
to kill me.

00:37:08.030 --> 00:37:10.000
Kunio,

00:37:10.000 --> 00:37:11.800
you lost, didn't you.

00:37:13.000 --> 00:37:14.300
What do you mean!

00:37:14.300 --> 00:37:15.900
I didn't run!

00:37:15.900 --> 00:37:19.100
That's because you were
frozen with fear!

00:37:19.870 --> 00:37:21.070
So...

00:37:21.070 --> 00:37:23.170
hurry up and tell him.

00:37:36.880 --> 00:37:39.000
- You see...
- Murai,

00:37:39.000 --> 00:37:40.820
promise me one thing.

00:37:40.820 --> 00:37:42.120
Huh?

00:37:44.000 --> 00:37:46.500
Never talk bad about your
father again.

00:37:52.100 --> 00:37:54.800
You see your dad,

00:37:54.800 --> 00:37:57.800
loved your mother
with all his life.

00:38:04.390 --> 00:38:07.790
He decided to love only her
for his whole life.

00:38:09.210 --> 00:38:11.000
If you don't come to love him,

00:38:11.000 --> 00:38:13.200
then your mother will
be sad, right?

00:38:20.890 --> 00:38:22.260
See ya...

00:38:24.310 --> 00:38:26.190
Onizuka-sensei!

00:38:26.850 --> 00:38:29.650
Aren't you going to ask
about his secret?

00:38:34.350 --> 00:38:36.850
This guy? He'll tell me
when he's ready.

00:38:44.140 --> 00:38:45.640
Murai...

00:38:46.640 --> 00:38:48.380
I'll always be waiting.

00:38:49.230 --> 00:38:50.530
Okay?

00:39:01.530 --> 00:39:03.330
Onizuka-sensei!

00:39:06.270 --> 00:39:10.460
I thought Onizuka-sensei could
do something for you.

00:39:10.460 --> 00:39:12.070
So I asked him.

00:39:14.610 --> 00:39:18.450
But then the brakes failed!

00:39:18.450 --> 00:39:23.850
I was supposed to stop
at the last second.

00:39:29.200 --> 00:39:31.900
To have someone who would
risk his own life for you

00:39:31.900 --> 00:39:33.900
as your homeroom teacher
is amazing!

00:39:35.100 --> 00:39:38.300
You know, if I had someone like
him for my homeroom teacher,

00:39:38.300 --> 00:39:39.700
I would have gone to school.

00:39:43.050 --> 00:39:44.450
Stupid!

00:39:59.890 --> 00:40:01.790
What did you want to talk about?

00:40:02.950 --> 00:40:06.900
- You said before...
- What's that?

00:40:08.130 --> 00:40:10.630
You said, he wasn't a teacher.

00:40:11.230 --> 00:40:12.720
Yeah.

00:40:12.720 --> 00:40:17.430
So you mean he's different
from other adults?

00:40:18.800 --> 00:40:23.300
That he's different from all
the other instructor's we've had?

00:40:25.090 --> 00:40:26.490
Yeah.

00:40:32.260 --> 00:40:34.460
You... Are you going to...

00:40:35.480 --> 00:40:37.630
talk to Onizuka about him?

00:40:39.580 --> 00:40:40.980
What do you think?

00:40:42.910 --> 00:40:44.810
What about Miyabi?

00:40:46.350 --> 00:40:48.370
She'll never forgive you.

00:41:32.200 --> 00:41:35.050
Yo, Murai! What's up?

00:41:36.000 --> 00:41:38.600
I have something to talk
to Onizuka-sensei about.

00:41:39.360 --> 00:41:42.000
If you've got something
to talk about, I'll listen.

00:41:42.000 --> 00:41:43.000
Okay, what is it?

00:41:44.940 --> 00:41:47.140
Murai, it's okay, you can tell me.

00:41:47.140 --> 00:41:50.510
- Shaddap.
- C'mon, you can trust me!

00:41:50.510 --> 00:41:53.500
You just want people
to believe you're a good person.

00:41:53.500 --> 00:41:55.810
- What's that?
- You just preach to us.

00:41:55.810 --> 00:41:59.330
You just want to see us
agree with you.

00:41:59.330 --> 00:42:01.900
You don't really understand
any of our feelings!

00:42:01.900 --> 00:42:04.300
You aren't really worried
or concerned for us!

00:42:04.300 --> 00:42:06.550
Murai! Hey you!
Come back here!

00:42:06.550 --> 00:42:08.480
What's with that attitude!

00:42:08.480 --> 00:42:11.780
Don't mess with me!
Don't try to make a fool of me!

00:42:13.100 --> 00:42:14.500
What are you looking at?

00:42:14.500 --> 00:42:16.660
- Damn you!
- C'mon!

00:42:25.710 --> 00:42:27.610
Who do you think you are?

00:42:29.940 --> 00:42:32.760
Murai, you're just a spoiled brat!

00:42:32.760 --> 00:42:34.500
- What are you doing!
- Do you hear me?

00:42:34.500 --> 00:42:35.500
Stop it!

00:42:35.500 --> 00:42:37.160
I'm talking to you!
Do you hear me?!

00:42:37.160 --> 00:42:40.960
That Onizuka, he's no teacher!
He's nothing!

00:42:40.960 --> 00:42:42.060
Hakamada-sensei!

00:42:42.060 --> 00:42:46.560
Why won't you talk to me!
You hear me?

00:42:46.560 --> 00:42:47.800
Please stop!

00:42:47.800 --> 00:42:50.100
This'll be corporal punishment!

00:42:56.900 --> 00:42:58.500
Murai-kun.

00:43:23.340 --> 00:43:26.160
This is why I can't trust teachers!

00:43:30.670 --> 00:43:32.570
Murai-kun!

00:43:39.330 --> 00:43:43.030
- You've been mistaken.
- Fuyutsuki-sensei...

00:43:43.030 --> 00:43:47.730
Certainly, it may be wonderful
to sweat.

00:43:49.450 --> 00:43:52.750
However... as a teacher...

00:43:52.750 --> 00:43:57.350
you should first think
of the students.

00:43:57.850 --> 00:44:00.550
Don't you think that's
more important?

00:45:11.300 --> 00:45:13.100
Don't ever betray me again!

00:45:27.100 --> 00:45:28.300
Ready!

00:45:30.280 --> 00:45:31.780
I ain't gonna die!

00:45:31.780 --> 00:45:33.880
- I'm Murai, 'k!
- Okay!

00:45:35.220 --> 00:45:37.520
Oh no! My foot's stuck
and I can't move!

00:45:43.730 --> 00:45:46.030
Your arms are all wrong.

00:45:46.400 --> 00:45:48.300
You're holding your
arms all wrong!

00:45:50.140 --> 00:45:52.640
Like this, 45 degrees.

00:45:56.200 --> 00:45:58.200
2016-05

